{{Top}}
'''H. Ploodrib'l''' was an individual who,<ref name="Rebel Resolve">{{Rebels|Rebel Resolve}}</ref> approximately four [[Standard year|years]] before the [[Battle of Yavin]],<ref name="Star Wars: Galactic Atlas">"[[Rebel Resolve]]" directly follows "[[Call to Action]]," which ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates to [[4 BBY]].</ref> was imprisoned along with many others by the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Rebel Resolve" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The name "H. Ploodrib'l" first appeared in "[[Rebel Resolve]]," the twelfth episode of [[Star Wars Rebels Season One|the first season]] of ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''; written in [[Aurebesh]] in a [[prisoner]] data file. The designation "CA-1977" next to their name<ref name="Rebel Resolve" /> seems to be a reference to [[1977]], the year {{Film|IV}} was released.<ref name="Star Wars: Episode IV A New Hope">{{Film|IV}}</ref> The designations "AD-1980" and "TK-1983" appear next to the names of the next two prisoners, [[Cay Ploon Kett]] and [[L. Izz Nezz]] respectively;<ref name="Rebel Resolve" /> [[1980]] was the year {{Film|V}} was released,<ref name="Star Wars: Episode V The Empire Strikes Back">{{Film|V}}</ref> while {{Film|6}} was released in [[1983]].<ref name="Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi">{{Film|VI}}</ref> "WN-1999" appears next to another prisoner's name, [[Ril Ion Aire]];<ref name="Rebel Resolve" /> [[1999]] was the release of year {{Film|I}}.<ref name="Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace">{{Film|I}}</ref>

